general_comments.body:
Noticing that v3.9.0 altered scatter plots that set line properties such as `fill: true`, but did not set `showLine: true`.  

I realize support without `showLine` was [probably](https://www.chartjs.org/docs/3.9.1/charts/scatter.html#dataset-properties) never intended, but I'm leaving a note here for posterity in case anyone else encounters this!

Simple test case:
```js
{
  type: 'scatter',
  data: {
    datasets: [{
      data: [{x:1,y:1}, {x:2,y:2}],
      backgroundColor: '#de000055',
      fill: true,
    }]
  }
}
```
Before (3.8.2)
![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/310310/202863696-b1421791-6701-41c3-9dbd-2218ea16893c.png)

After (3.9.0)
![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/310310/202863702-c3bfa59b-ca26-4971-906d-f7fe83fd0063.png)

